Depends: systemd, coreutils, grep, sed, util-linux, bsdutils, ${misc:Depends}
Description: MacBook Pro (M5 Pro) deep sleep configuration (Aurora)
 Deep sleep on the MacBook Pro (M5 Pro, J714s): suspend is deep sleep only,
 the lid suspends on battery, on AC and docked, and a system-sleep hook arms a
 safety PMU RTC alarm before a suspend that has none, as the T6050 sleep
 driver requires. The package is installed on every Mac and does nothing on
 any Mac other than the J714s.
